.TH DANBY-PERIHELION 1
.SH NAME
danby-perihelion \- relativistic precession of planetary perihelion
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/perihelion
.SH MODEL
A leading post-Newtonian radial correction depends on angular momentum and
inverse radius. Increasing its coefficient rotates successive perihelia while
the Newtonian limit closes the orbit.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/perihelion.b
